  {
    "id": "2458819",
    "original": "しかしながら、未知の外国語を聞くとき、我々は異なる単語を聞き分けることができず、発言をほとんど休止のない音の連続であると認識します。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "2458803",
        "text": "However, when listening to an unknown foreign language, our ability to discern different words is lost, and we recognize speech as being a stream of sounds without many pauses."
